# text_id = 1059
# text = Now that Mauretania has democracy for the first time , I hope that the Minister and the Government will start to work with that country to ensure that it is helped not just to police the flow of illegal immigrants to Europe , but to gain jobs and prosperity so that people do not feel the need to migrate .
