# text_id = 1064
# text = I welcome the early re-institution of the Executive and the Assembly , but , in relation to my right hon . Friend 's comments on initial decisions on the security front , a fine confidence - building response would be to order the early demolition of the Barouki tower , known as the crow 's nest , in Crossmaglen square .
