# text_id = 1111
# text = Despite the cogent points made by the hon . Member for Sittingbourne and Sheppey and the misgivings to which I referred , I believe that the Bill — which , I deeply regret , will impose difficulties on many traders , including many of my constituents — will make a significant contribution to making Kent a place with less property crime .
