# text_id = 1132
# text = Despite the fact that the number of pupils with statements of SEN has gone up by 7 per cent to 250,550 since 1997 , I was disturbed , as were other noble Lords , to see that 79 special schools have closed and that the number of pupils being taught in special schools has declined by 5 per cent to 93,880 .
