# text = I welcome what my hon . Friend says about including all domiciliary care agencies in the proposed regulations , but can he provide an assurance on domiciliary care workers in particular , many of whom do an excellent job , provide a high standard of care and enable people to remain in their homes , which is usually their choice ?
