# text_id = 1170
# text = The home detention curfew scheme is probably the clearest possible message that the Government could send that they are soft on crime , soft on the cause of crimes and wholly indifferent to the fate of the victims who have been created by people who have been released from prison but who would not have been released but for the scheme .
