# text_id = 1171
# text = As regards Amendment No. 37 , it is interesting that this is a deregulatory Bill and that , on the one hand , the Government are keen that much of the decision - making should be devolved to local authorities , and yet , on the other hand , the Bill stipulates what should be the size of the committee .
