# text_id = 1173
# text = Xenophobia , racism and all the other matters to which hon . Members rightly referred have no place in our society , full stop , and certainly not under any pretext of supporting a football team or , as the hon . Member for Northampton , South ( Mr. Clarke ) said , any other form of social or sporting activity .
