# text_id = 1180
# text = The Minister , Fiona Mactaggart , when confronted by the fact that the Charity Commission considered that the draft Bill would not alter the legal status quo under existing case law vis -à - vis independent schools and private hospitals , asserted before the Joint Committee that that was wrong and that the Government would scarcely be bringing forward the public benefit change for it to be ineffectual in practice .
