# text_id = 1181
# text = As the Minister said , I am not one for filibustering , although I like to take him to task on the provisions in detail , but we simply cannot say at this stage that 16 sittings are enough ; nor can we say that it is adequate — and I am sure it is not right — for consideration and Third Reading to take place on one curtailed day .
