# text_id = 1184
# text = I would feel much happier if the provision was not just left to the words in the Bill , but that the amendment at least added something to the effect of , " if the alternative to withholding sustenance were also to he life - threatening and a choice had to be made between these two alternatives as to which would give the patient a better chance of life " .
