# text_id = 1190
# text = If the review is to look at targeting , will he make sure that targets set — whether at local or national level — in order to get rid of health inequalities are not removed , but are improved , so that we can address health inequalities in a serious way and have a national health service that deals with that matter better than it has in the past ?
