# text_id = 1193
# text = Although the right hon . Member for Hitchin and Harpenden ( Mr. Lilley ) is not one of the House of Commons members of the Joint Committee , I am sure that , when the Bill comes back , he will cast his experienced and beady eye over the detail of those matters in which he considers there is some vulnerability so as to ensure that the House discusses them properly .
