# text_id = 1194
# text = Although there are seven options in the Joint Committee 's report for the future membership of your Lordships ' House , I find myself without an option to support as my first choice , because I remain a holder of the view that in an ideal world we should have a unicameral system and I fear that there would be little chance of the one House being this one .
