# text = Looking round at some of the distinguished Members present , some of whom have served in Ministries and some of whom have been enormously important members of the Treasury , I am sure that they already understand the measure , but in case anyone has the slightest shade of doubt about what clause 102 and schedule 30 do , I inform them that they prevent the practice of mixing .
