# text = In the light of his admirable decision to stand shoulder to shoulder with our American allies over those terrible events , will he now , once and for all , state whether he is prepared to stand shoulder to shoulder with them over ballistic missile defence , particularly in view of the fact that more than 200 of his parliamentary colleagues are clearly massively opposed to ballistic missile defence ?
