# text = My Lords , perhaps I can tempt the Minister to say whether she agrees with the noble Lord , Lord Haskins , who , when he gave evidence to the EFRA Select Committee on 17 December , said that , " if you cannot implement big chunks of my proposals you will not be able to deliver Curry and you will not be able to deliver CAP reform " .
