# text_id = 1209
# text = Let me accept , in the spirit of cross - party co-operation , that what the hon . Member for Linlithgow ( Mr. Dalyell ) said is perfectly right , but I am aware of the way in which time is marching on and I do not consider that the fact that that particular detail was not included in my remarks alters the thrust of what I am attempting to say .
