# text_id = 1214
# text = But there was also an assumption that after a reasonable period of transition Northern Ireland and the three sets of relationships within the Province — within Ireland north and south and within these islands — would be characterised by peace , stability and reconciliation , and that that prize would be sufficient to persuade the leaders of loyalism and republicanism to set aside those who were involved in violence .
