# text_id = 1217
# text = That this House takes note of European Union Document No. 12588/05 , draft regulation to replace Regulation 2320 / 02 on civil aviation security ; welcomes the Commission 's initiative in producing a clearer , shorter text which will give more legal certainty ; and endorses the Government 's intention to work with the Presidency , the European Parliament and other Member States to resolve outstanding areas of difficulty .
