# text = The answer that the Minister has just given will be of some relief to people who have been approached by these claims handlers , who have not merely handled their claims inadequately and charged them money when they should not have done , but transferred their claims by selling them on , often to poorly qualified solicitors who have done an extraordinarily poor job of handling claims for mining injuries .
