# text = We have turned an existing savings rule , which was both capped and seriously heavy in terms of its implication for deemed income , into something which is not capped and which for about 95 per cent of pensioners reflects a rate of return which will be either less than or at the existing rate of return from any capital in a building society account or long - term bond .
