# text_id = 1222
# text = We are introducing , it is suggested , the phrase " core elements " when , as I say , the Government have every ability and opportunity under this clause to say what they want and what they do not want and , indeed , to alter that assertion from time to time if they feel that they have required too much or too little in the home information pack .
