# text_id = 1226
# text = We should remember that we are talking about services that involve assisting people in going to the toilet , using a bedpan , keeping the skin around catheters and stomas clean , changing incontinence pads , and keeping their skin clean because of their incontinence ; assisting people with food ; dealing with immobility ; and medical treatments such the application of creams , lotions , eye drops and dressings .
