# text_id = 1228
# text = If our proposals are accepted , we will increase domestic funding for regional policy by the amount that our regions would have received under a no-reform scenario in an enlarged EU , and focus those additional resources on areas of high unemployment and low GDP , as typically seen in regions with current objective 1 status and in the constituencies of hon . Members who have contributed to the debate .
