# text_id = 1231
# text = We have made the point that that contract was , of course , started by the right hon . Member for Kensington and Chelsea ( Mr. Portillo ) — sadly , he is no longer in the Chamber , although he was here when it was first mentioned — but , fair enough , we allowed the contract to proceed , and our intention was to ensure best value for money .
