# text_id = 1232
# text = For all those reasons , we strongly advocate a reform of adoption law so that it is possible for more of those children to leave care and to be adopted in a family — a family that is there not just till the child reaches the age of 16 or 18 or some other fixed limit , but in which , as in any family , a child is for life .
