# text = Is the Secretary of State aware that it costs Royal Mail 25 per cent . more to operate its services than it costs its competitors , that it is 40 per cent . less efficient , and that any attempts by the trade unions to prevent the modernisation of the service will result only in Royal Mail becoming less efficient and ultimately cost more jobs in the long run ?
