# text = If she — or someone on behalf of the appropriate Committee — makes representations to the Football Association , will they bear in mind that it seems significant that small clubs such as Luton , and Chesterfield a few years ago , have points deducted , but West Ham got involved in a major wrangle over two players last year and did not have points deducted as was supposed to happen ?
