# text = I am grateful to the Secretary of State for the letter that she sent me first thing this morning , although the website referred to in it did not contain any detail of the rural strategy , and for a copy of her statement , which for various reasons , including a mishap — I am not sure whose — I have only seen in the past 15 minutes or so .
