# text_id = 1244
# text = In so far as he has mentioned matters such as stamp duty land tax , VAT and many other things , I say in terms to him that he is absolutely obliged to respond to whatever noble Lords say about those matters and that it would be very serious if , for reasons about which I know nothing , he were to ignore all our remarks on those topics .
