# text_id = 1246
# text = I therefore strongly urge that we note the fact that the state aid rules are being stretched and that a change in the over - regulation inflicted on our businesses can be achieved only by applying the rule of the supremacy of Parliament , an amendment on which the Conservative party supported me during the passage of the Legislative and Regulatory Reform Bill , both in the Commons and the Lords .
