# text = One only has to think of the workers at Allied Steel and Wire , who are coming to London to march following the effective winding - up of their schemes , and those at Blyth and Blyth in Scotland , following the announcement last week , and those at 50 other companies , to see that action is needed to reform the law on the winding - up of pensions .
