# text = The Bill provides that where a person has ceased to hold office as the ombudsman or acting ombudsman , he is prevented for a period of three years from holding an office that is a listed authority , from being a member , co-opted member , officer or member of staff of a listed authority and from holding a paid office to which appointment is by a listed authority .
