# text_id = 1257
# text = Will my right hon . Friend do everything possible to undermine the religious bigotry that exists in schools in Northern Ireland , and give young people the broadest possible understanding of both religious and secular value systems , so that the inter- generational problems that we see in Northern Ireland can begin to be tackled where it really counts — at home and in the early years at school ?
