# text = It is not the Minister , nor even the Secretary of State , but the Chancellor of the Exchequer , who is absolutely confident that , by extending these credits both through his Department and — I hope that the Minister will not be embarrassed by this — his proxies in the Department for Work and Pensions he will be able to raise the living standards of poorer pensioners .
