# text = Perhaps despite the eloquence of his argument , I believe that we must make it clear that staff are essential and important from the very outset and that there may be benefits in making it explicit that staff must be included in the training provision , so I am happy to say on this rare , but important occasion that the Government are happy to accept amendment No. 1 .
