# text = Previous attempts to bring together the European members of the alliance , such as Eurogroup , for various purposes , including response to American pressure that they should carry a larger share of the burden , have failed for the lack of any political body to back them partly , ironically , because of American suspicions that the Europeans , if organised together , would gang up against them .
