# text = I agree entirely with what the hon . Gentleman says about enlargement , but does he agree that there is a certain irony in the fact that , among the accession countries , nation states such as Slovakia — a country of 5 million people , without a single centimetre of coastline — will have more direct say over the Scottish fishing industry than the devolved Government of Scotland ?
