# text = So , with Bristol , Nottingham and Birmingham today joining Newcastle , Manchester and York as " science cities " , I intend , after consultation , to enhance the R and D tax credit for mid-sized research companies ; stimulate small technology - intensive companies with a guaranteed £ 100 million share of public sector research contracts ; and offer funding incentives for universities opening their research facilities to business .
