# text = However , there is concern among the same community — I hope that the Minister will give us some reassurance about it — that , because of pressure from various parts of the financial services industry , new hurdles will be placed in the way of those seeking redress from the financial ombudsman in the form of greater opportunities for appeal by institutions against whom complaints had been upheld .
