# text_id = 1277
# text = As I understand it , proposed new paragraph 6A ( 2 ) of Schedule 2B to the Gas Act 1986 and proposed new paragraph 12 ( 4 ) of Schedule 7 to the 1989 Act , which would be deleted , allow us to enable suppliers not to apply a differential between pre-payment and standard tariff , and therefore not to disadvantage pre-payment customers , or indeed vice versa .
