# text = I apologise , but I cannot recall whether my right hon . and learned Friend was at business questions last Thursday , but I point out to him and to the Deputy Leader of the House that my right hon . Friend the Member for North - West Hampshire ( Sir George Young ) raised exactly that point about there not being enough time for proper debate on the motions .
