# text = However , is he aware of my concern and those of other debt campaigners that the problem for those countries that are currently going through the heavily indebted poor countries initiative , and those that would wish to do so in the near future , is that even the World Bank has suggested that their future economic sustainability may mean that they will not be able to meet their current targets ?
