# text = I am not saying that the EU will be in Afghanistan instead of NATO , but we are at the point where European Union countries and other countries — the hon . Gentleman mentioned Ukraine and Turkey , but there are others — can work together in policing , monitoring and even military operations , as we have seen them do successfully in Africa and other parts of the world .
