# text_id = 1284
# text = If we assume that it is 100 per cent — that is , double the standard fee being given if successful ; it certainly would not be more than 100 per cent , and could well be less — it would mean that lawyers would not take a case unless the chances of success were greater than 50 per cent , otherwise they would end up being out of pocket .
